### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### Get all notes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notes

###

### Create a new note
POST http://localhost:5000/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Note",
  "content": "This is the content of my first note",
  "tags": ["personal", "ideas"]
}

###

### Get a specific note (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notes/YOUR_NOTE_ID_HERE

###

### Update a note (replace with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/notes/YOUR_NOTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Note Title",
  "content": "Updated content",
  "tags": ["updated", "modified"]
}

###

### Delete a note (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/notes/YOUR_NOTE_ID_HERE

